<MockSection Path="/find-us" Heading="Find us">
    <p>Open Tuesday to Sunday: lunch 12:00 to 15:00, and dinner 18:00 to 21:30 from Thursday to Saturday. Closed
        Mondays.</p>
    <p>Sixty seats inside and on the stoep, wheelchair access, and parking behind the restaurant. Groups of more than
        twelve, and private functions, by arrangement with the owner.</p>
